# AI-Powered Cybersecurity Early-Warning System

An AI-driven cybersecurity monitoring system designed to identify **pre-attack behavioral patterns** from network and host logs and generate an **early warning before an attack occurs**.

The system analyzes sequences of network, authentication, and system events instead of relying only on signatures of attacks that have already occurred.

---

## Overview

Traditional IDS/IPS solutions primarily focus on detecting malicious activity after recognizable attack indicators appear.

This project focuses on an earlier stage:

```text
Normal Activity
      ↓
Suspicious Behavioral Pattern
      ↓
Early Warning
      ↓
Predicted Attack
      ↓
Attack Occurs
